the sources named here say. Check the licence texts themselves before you publish an image.

- The image contains the Arduino core for ESP32 (LGPL-2.1-or-later). LGPL-2.1, section 6, asks a
  distributor of a binary that contains the library to give notice that the library is used,
  to supply a copy of the licence, and to make it possible for the recipient to change the
  library and relink the program (for example by giving access to the complete source from
  the same place, section 6(d)). This project publishes its complete source code, the pinned
  versions of the platform and packages (firmware/platformio.ini) and the build instructions
